From eecae20f771d1d63278bb0b51c20e719cb564999 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Roscoe <bryanroscoe@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:28:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Effects: preserve action-specific tracked antecedents

Keep earlier exiled populations across unrelated scoped sacrifices, preserve fresh sacrifice consumers, and retain detached tails across automatic replacement pauses. Cover real cast paths, choices, empty results and replacement continuations in the existing unit harness.
---
 crates/engine/src/game/effects/mod.rs | 673 +++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 615 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/engine/src/game/effects/mod.rs b/crates/engine/src/game/effects/mod.rs
